o  his generally kind personality he's not  really someone who goes over the top in  committing acts of violence in fact he  rather wouldn't do it at all so when  people like all-4-one and stay in a  going viral for their actions people  don't really gravitate to gentles  content I guess because for a lack of a  better word is just a bit too gentle  but despite averaging about 10 views per  video gentle did manage to snag himself  a super fan in his sidekick la Brava  now the braava is someone who a certain  stage in her life was very depressed and  glued to her computer all day she  happened to stumble across gentles  channel and was inspired by his optimism  she tracked him down using how awesome  coding skills which gentl didn't find  creepy at all for some reason and in  fact he believed that they would make  the perfect team one last thing before  we move on to explaining his quirk it  wouldn't be a gentle criminal video if I  didn't mention the fact that this guy  loves t-t-to gentle criminal is what all  my Easter Deco just to give you a bit of  perspective in fact as I said just  before he ruined his life he was coming  out of the cafe like this guy can't be  stopped  but the way he paused the tea so  dramatically I think the ratio of tea  poured to tea that ends up in the cup is  probably not the best here anyway  gentle criminals quark has a lot of  different practical applications which  make him incredibly dangerous putting it  simply his quark is called elasticity  and it allows him to make anything he  touches stretchy and elastic so  basically like the inverse of Luffy from  one piece just to get your header on  this I'm gonna lay out a couple of  examples as to how he uses this quark so  firstly he can touch the ground and turn  it elastic and make it into a trampoline  this has the knock-on effects of sending  enemies flying into the air or because  he's mastered this power he can do the  exact same thing but instead sent  himself flying into the air in a  controlled manner another example would  be his gently rebound attack in which he  turns the air itself elastic this means  that anyone who runs into the air will  then be violently blasted in the other  direction and because air is usually  invisible is a great way to catch  enemies by surprise they'll literally  just run into it and they'll be thrown  back in the opposite direction the  dangerous thing about this quirk is that  he can manipulate virtually any  situation to his advantage  as I said he can turn the air elastic  which gives him a massive element of  surprise whilst also providing him with  a quick and easy method of escaping and  it also makes him pretty agile as well  as he can change direction fairly easily  some interesting things to note about  this quirk is that elasticity cannot be  canceled out by someone else's quirk  rather it can only disappear after a  period of time has passed so what I'm  saying is that once he's turned  something elastic nothing is going to  make that thing not elastic anymore you  just have to wait until the time has  passed now some people may perceive this  as a weakness as gentle doesn't exactly  control when the elasticity turns off  but given the way we've seen him use it  it doesn't really seem to be too much of  a drawback without getting in to plot  spoilers we've seen that gentle criminal  can make heavy objects elastic and then  use them in ways that would otherwise be  impossible when we go back to his stats  we see that besides having a 5 out of 6  for loving T he also has a 4 out of 6  face technique now I personally think  that his techniques should be higher  than this simply for the fact that if  you told me of this power I'd have  assumed that being able to turn the air  elastic would be the pinnacle of a quirk  like this it's super impressive that  gentle is able to do this  despite  never even finishing his formal hero  training remember he got expelled from  school in the second year and it wasn't  even that good of a school so to have  master disc work in this way and to be  able to take down multiple professional  heroes albeit average professional  heroes it's still super impressive when  we first saw his quirk in action  he turned the entire shop into what  looks like strawberry jelly  so yeah awesome quirk great technique  and ultimately he's gonna be a tough  tough villain to be defeated but anyway  guys that was my quick breakdown of  gentle criminals back story and his  quirk was this whole arc is dumb that  I'm gonna do a video looking forward  regarding certain characters involved in  this arc and if you like this video then  be sure to subscribe to the channel if  not to me then at least a gentle  criminal you owe him that much and be  sure to check out my latest theory video  where I deconstruct why Kirishima was in  fact the third user of one for all and  yes it makes sense but until next time  peace out
 

